nt-bold mr-2\">✔</span><strong>No hidden fees</strong> or last-minute surprise charges. Ever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Price List Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-16 sm:py-24 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Transparent Price List</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto -mt-4 mb-12\">No hidden costs, no surprises. We believe in upfront and honest pricing for our <strong>AC repair services in Panoli GIDC</strong>. Prices are for labor and may vary based on parts needed.</p>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6\">\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-6\">\r\n<div class=\"border-b pb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Window AC Service</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Standard Service <span class=\"font-bold\">₹499</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Jet Pump Service <span class=\"font-bold\">₹799</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-b pb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Split AC Service</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Standard Service <span class=\"font-bold\">₹599</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Jet Pump Service <span class=\"font-bold\">₹999</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-b pb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Installation / Uninstallation</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Window AC <span class=\"font-bold\">Starting from ₹700</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Split AC <span class=\"font-bold\">Starting from ₹1,500</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-b pb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Gas Charging</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Up to 1.5 Ton <span class=\"font-bold\">Starting from ₹2,500</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\">Up to 2.5 Ton <span class=\"font-bold\">Starting from ₹3,500</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"md:col-span-2 border-b pb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Industrial &amp; Specialized Units</h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 flex justify-between\"><strong>Chiller, AHU, Ductable, Panel AC</strong> <span class=\"font-bold\">Contact for Custom Quote</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"md:col-span-2 text-center pt-4\">\r\n<p class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Inspection/Visit Charge: ₹299</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">(This amount is adjusted if you proceed with the repair service)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Services Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Our HVAC &amp; AC Repair Services</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto -mt-4 mb-12\">From a simple <strong>split AC not cooling</strong> at home to a complete <strong>industrial chiller plant breakdown</strong>, we handle it all. We are your one-stop solution for every cooling need in Panoli GIDC, Ankleshwar.</p>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><!-- Service Item -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg overflow-hidden card-shadow text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/emergency-ac-repair-in-Vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Emergency AC Repair Service\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">AC Not Cooling? We Fix It Fast.</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">The most common issue. We diagnose everything from compressor faults to refrigerant leaks.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Item -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg overflow-hidden card-shadow text-center\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/